        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Large Door Pull with Domed Ends</b>\r\n<p>\r\nA back to back pair of very clean designed large 1-1/2\" diameter pull handles. They can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, glass doors. Just about anywhere a large door pull is needed. Made in the USA by First Impressions\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions Model #11DB Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 25-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes Back to Back Mounting Hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These First Impression door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 10 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n<br>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-diameter-large-door-pull-with-domed-ends-first-impressions-11dx\"><b>First Impressions Model #11D</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Door Pull with Domed Ends, Pair, First Impressions 11DB",
                "description": "First Impressions 11DB door pull. A back to back pair of very clean designed large 1-1/2 inch diameter pull handles. They can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, glass doors. Just about anywhere a large door pull is needed. Made in the USA by First Impressions",
                "keywords": "FII-PR-11DB Large Door Pull with Domed Ends, FII-11Dx 1-1/2 Diameter Large Door Pulls,  First Impressions 11Dx 1-1/2 Diameter Large Door Pulls, contemporary Large Door Pulls, contemporary glass door pulls, FII-11DB 25-1/2 inch door pulls, FII-11DA 21-1/2 inch door pulls, First Impressions 11DB door pulls,"
